@title Build mode: take a step so a second person does not reach for the same one
@area Cabinet
# Reports > Build mode: "I take this step" shows who is on a step; "Let go" gives it back. The claim is kept in the project and travels in the field file.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Build mode..."
wait 30
expect "I take this step"
shot before
check_layout
click_text "I take this step" Button
wait 10
expect "You have this step"
shot taken
check_layout
click_text "Let go" Button
wait 10
expect "I take this step"
shot let-go
